; A stock priced by its purchase posting is fetched in the batch call.
; Written stock first, the posting records AAPL's price in $; the base
; read the inverted link "$ in AAPL" as an exchange and left AAPL out
; of the batch (588.test's journal lost AAPL the same way).

2024/01/15 Buy
    Assets:Brokerage        10 AAPL
    Assets:Checking        $-1000.00

test bal Assets:Brokerage --market --now 2030/06/15 --download --getquote $sourcepath/test/scripts/mock-getquote-batch-only.sh
            $1500.00  Assets:Brokerage
end test
